AmiScreamer - debug programs
============================

This drawer holds AmiScreamer with all its test and measuring functions (logs, timing, test drives, screenshots
through the environment variables OS_...). The normal programs (amiscreamer_060 and so on) do not have them. The
debug programs are meant for testers and for finding faults; for playing the normal ones are enough.

  amiscreamer_debug_080            debug program for Vampire (68080)
  amiscreamer_debug_060            debug program for 68060
  amiscreamer_debug_040            debug program for 68040
  amiscreamer_debug_mos            debug program for MorphOS (PowerPC)
  Benchmark                        speed measurement, guide in Benchmark_en

The programs belong in the drawer of the installed game (where DATA/, GFX/, CONFIG/ and MUSIC/ are) and are
started from the Shell.


